{"id":"n38745-1-9","stage":5,"title":"기고 · 投稿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38745-1-9-1","ko":"나 이제부터 잡지에 고정 기고를 할 수 있게 되었어.","zh":"从现在开始，我就可以在杂志上定期投稿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제부터","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡지에","meaning":"杂志","explanation":"잡지：杂志；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62518","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고정","meaning":"固定","explanation":"고정：固定","readings":[{"term":"고정","audio":"/audio/8a98dfb08e979200599a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27141","senseId":"1","lemma":"고정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기고를","meaning":"投稿","explanation":"기고：投稿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기고","audio":"/audio/540f3d0c8921d95a3bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38745","senseId":"1","lemma":"기고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있게","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"d6064de0a4717871","term":"잡지","zh":"杂志","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3","entryId":"62518","definition":"定期发行的书，有各种内容的新闻、照片、广告等。","pronunciation":["잡찌"]},{"id":"8a98dfb08e979200","term":"고정","zh":"固定","audio":"/audio/8a98dfb08e979200599a.mp3","entryId":"27141","definition":"一旦定下的内容不再变更。","pronunciation":["고정"]},{"id":"540f3d0c8921d95a","term":"기고","zh":"投稿","audio":"/audio/540f3d0c8921d95a3bed.mp3","entryId":"38745","definition":"为了在报纸或杂志上登载而撰写稿子投寄；或指那些稿子。","pronunciation":["기고"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3334b1fead968bc3071d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38745-1-9-2","ko":"그럼 잡지에 네 글이 계속 실리는 거야?","zh":"那么你的文章会一直刊登在杂志上吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡지에","meaning":"杂志","explanation":"잡지：杂志；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62518","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글이","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실리는","meaning":"被刊载，被登载","explanation":"실리다：被刊载，被登载；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"실리다","audio":"/audio/1d65a16bd08db85a577c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14085","senseId":"2","lemma":"실리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"(贬称)人或动物。","explanation":"거：(贬称)人或动物。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"d6064de0a4717871","term":"잡지","zh":"杂志","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3","entryId":"62518","definition":"定期发行的书，有各种内容的新闻、照片、广告等。","pronunciation":["잡찌"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"1d65a16bd08db85a","term":"실리다","zh":"被刊载，被登载","audio":"/audio/1d65a16bd08db85a577c.mp3","entryId":"14085","definition":"文章或照片等在书或报纸等上印刷出来。","pronunciation":["실리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"(贬称)人或动物。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"(贬称)人或动物。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/146f7b7aeb4ecb7f3905.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.447,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38745","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从现在开始，我就可以在杂志上定期投稿了。","那么你的文章会一直刊登在杂志上吗？","昨天在活动上的时候啊，多亏了那位知名歌手的演出，现场气氛非常好。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从现在开始，我就可以在杂志上定期投稿了。","那么你的文章会一直刊登在杂志上吗？","昨天在活动上的时候啊，多亏了那位知名歌手的演出，现场气氛非常好。"],"answer":1}]}
